                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_Pjkqeq": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>If your main goal is skin, hair, and nails, start with Complete Collagen. If your main goal is daily protein with skin support alongside it, start with Thrive Protein. Both are daily sachets, both are Halal and EU-made, and both work on their own.</p>",
                        "highlight_style": "none",
                        "highlight_font_style": "italic",
